.TH "SCCFM-CLI OBJECTS NETWORK-GROUP DELETE" "1" "2026-09-02" "0.41.0" "sccfm-cli objects network-group delete Manual"
.SH NAME
sccfm-cli\-objects\-network-group\-delete \- Delete a network group object.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sccfm-cli objects network-group delete
[OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Delete a network group object.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-u,\fP \-\-uid TEXT
The unique identifier (UID) of the object.
.TP
\fB\-n,\fP \-\-name TEXT
The name of the object (alternative to UID).
.TP
\fB\-\-check\fP
Run a preflight check without performing the operation.
.TP
\fB\-\-config\-path\fP PATH
Path to the configuration file (defaults to ~/.sccfm-cli/config.json).
